SUMMARY:🕉️ Swami Vivekananda Jayanti (National Youth Day)
DESCRIPTION:Birth anniversary (1863) of Swami Vivekananda\, observed nation
 wide as National Youth Day.\n\nFREE - regional/restricted holiday\, not a 
 nationwide day off.\nRegion: West Bengal (state holiday)\; National Youth 
 Day nationwide.\nDate is the same every year.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
