DESCRIPTION:Marks the Constitution of India coming into force on 26 January
  1950\; celebrated with the grand parade in Delhi.\n\nBUSY - nationwide pu
 blic holiday (Central Government).\nDate is the same every year.
TRANSP:OPAQUE
